<title>USA: USABancShares sets 33 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>USABancShares sets 33 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA, Pa. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USABancShares Inc said Tuesday it declared a 33 percent stock dividend, payable July 18 to shareholders of record as of July 1.</p>
<p>USABancShares also said it had consummated its most recent loan acquisition -- the discounted purchase of a performing $1.4 million loan participation with NationsBank.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
